            "review_title": "Review at Lẩu gà ớt hiểm",
            "review_text": "Rob Nesbit\nWarsaw, Poland6919 contributions\n1\ndidn't enjoy the food or the experience\nApr 2023\nHad fried chicken and chicken in a hot pot with some veg......with some accompanying dishes, washed down with beer.\n\nThe chicken to be frank was awful, badly cut and tasted cheap.....could have diced it better and there was a lot of bones and fat on the meat......plus with no knife and fork its hard to eat such meat..... resulting in a lot of wastage. Its the kind of food you'd feed the dog with.\n\nThe place was completely empty when we entered, despite it a Saturday night and everywhere else packed to the rafters - which is a big warning in itself....... it did have a few more customers after, perhaps we drew them in!\n\nService fine , friendly and efficient and the bill wasn't bad considering the portion size, of about 29 Euros, but we didn't enjoy the food or the experience. Bad food in an empty restaurant.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten May 4, 2023",
